Added the login providers to plone.restapi's `GET @login`, where `pas.plugins.oidc` and `pas.plugins.authomatic` list theirs, so a client written against it finds them. Each entry carries `id`, `plugin` (`identity`), `title` and `url`, plus the `driver` and the button's icon and colours under `style`. A `flow` key says what `url` is: `redirect` for `@login-providers/<id>`, `email` for `@magic-link`. @ericof
